  76+ 6D6A              ;    3 = At The Foot Of The Mega Tree
  77+ 6D6A              ;    4 = The Drive
  78+ 6D6A              ;    5 = The Security Guard
  79+ 6D6A              ;    6 = Entrance To Hades
  80+ 6D6A              ;    7 = Cuckoo's Nest
